# Template only — the real file (env/blue.runtime.env, gitignored) lives on
# the VPS. This is the ONLY var that legitimately differs between colors
# (see T4 / docs/core/blue-green-migrations.md) — consumed by apps/web (7+
# SSR/RSC call sites, see apps/web/lib/api-client.ts and friends) and
# apps/workers (the internal order-expiration sweep,
# apps/workers/src/jobs/orders/expire-orders.processor.ts). Both must point
# at THIS color's own api-<color> service — cross-color pairing (e.g. green's
# web hitting api-blue) is the easiest way to ship a subtly broken deploy.
INTERNAL_API_URL=http://api-blue:3000
